{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人張栢芝一向深受粉絲歡迎，所到之處都有不少Fans簇擁，日前她現身內地機場跟等候多時的粉絲聊天，穿上粉紅羽絨的她，獲粉絲講土味情話，逗得她笑不攏嘴，開心不已，差點連行經過了入閘口都不知道，要工作人員提醒。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.383173+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T16:01:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536221+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"394610bb98c3bd036ee86bfa09b2492e3e3534adede65cf5c1db75d9ead88911","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}